{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ta2buF12ZR1794823010.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產豪景花園首席分區經理譚榮輝表示，青龍頭豪景花園本月暫錄得4宗買賣成交，市況平穩。中原新近促成屋苑2期7座高層C室成交，實用面積715平方呎，三房套房間隔，享海景及園景，業主日前委託中原地產獨家放盤，叫價550萬元，放盤不足一星期成功沽出，減價18萬元，成交價532萬元，實用呎價7441元。<br/>譚榮輝表示，買家為上車客，見單位質素高，火速購入自用。原業主於1988年5月以86.7萬元一手購入單位，單位38年間大幅升值445.3萬元或5.1倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.810359+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:12.270638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:20.897457+00:00","content_hash":"62a6642f881e73cdf9a14cee3de7f29bfa8b42a533125493fd099b22d878a8f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.810359+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}